BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Session 14: Using GenAI to come closer to Jesus Christ Reply to To
 pic [IS 111-002]
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261210
DTSTAMP:20260912T110800Z
UID:event-sub-assignment-1451765
SEQUENCE:0
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Participate in the class discussion board by sharing one way y
 ou have used GenAI to draw closer to Jesus Christ. After posting\, please 
 read and comment on at least three posts from your classmates to contribut
 e to the discussion. You can post about anything you want\, but if you are
  struggling to get started\, you might consider how GenAI may be used to 
 \n\n* Help gather scattered Israel\n\n* Stay on the covenant path\n\n* Hel
 p others to find and stay on the covenant path\n\n* Minister to others\n\n
 * Build Zion in other ways\n\nPlease feel free to stretch and be expansive
  in your efforts. You might consider using the multi-modal capabilities of
  GenAI. \n\n*Note\, if you are of a non-Christian faith\, please consider
  how you can use GenAI to enhance your closeness to God.\n\nNot Required: 
 You might consider using AI to spruce up a bit what you learn by applying 
 vibe coding\, multimodal\, or other principles you have learned in this cl
 ass.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://byu.instructure.com/calendar?include_contexts=course
 _38450&month=12&year=2026#assignment_1451764
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://instruct
 ure-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/account_74070000000000001/attachments/8409020
 /dp_app.css"><p>Participate in the class discussion board by sharing <stro
 ng>one way</strong> you have used GenAI to draw closer to Jesus Christ. Af
 ter posting\, please read and comment on at least <strong>three </strong>p
 osts from your classmates to contribute to the discussion. You can post ab
 out anything you want\, but if you are struggling to get started\, you mig
 ht consider how GenAI may be used to&nbsp\;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Help gather sca
 ttered Israel</li>\n<li>Stay on the covenant path</li>\n<li>Help others to
  find and stay on the covenant path</li>\n<li>Minister to others</li>\n<li
 >Build Zion in other ways</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Please feel free to stretch and 
 be expansive in your efforts. You might consider using the multi-modal cap
 abilities of GenAI.&nbsp\;</p>\n<p>*Note\, if you are of a non-Christian f
 aith\, please consider how you can use GenAI to enhance your closeness to 
 God.<br><br><strong>Not Required:</strong> You might consider using AI to 
 spruce up a bit what you learn by applying vibe coding\, multimodal\, or o
 ther principles you have learned in this class.</p><script src="https://in
 structure-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/account_74070000000000001/attachments/8
 409019/dp_app.js"></script>
END:VEVENT
